            <ArticleTitle>[Experimental substantiation of the use of CO2 laser radiation for preventing suppuration of the surgical wound].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It was revealed, that irradiation in the experiment of the spore-forming and non-spore-forming microbial cultures, irrespective of the density of growth, was accompanied by their complete destruction in density of radiant energy of the &quot;Scalpel-1&quot; CO2-laser equal to 32.2 J/cm2 (power density--32.2 W/cm2) and more, and exposure for 1 s.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
